        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghawooda aba badayda mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adoosisi geat aseecheeka ak ea adoamiindi gidasisina geatinga ghana daraneeda, ak ea adoamiindi lagheaneeda sing'waar aba jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa, ak googadoowanayi; aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeang'waanya sabaatoheedeanyu nea goosisi mureeda heeda sigadoowaniisean: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iibiidi jeeda deaweedajeegeasu nea ghoawali diigheanyeekeasu nea goosinyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydagooneegwa roopta aba damandaanyi, ak gaygwanyagu ng'eanyiida boagaaschi nea geediga madamnyeanda gaygwanyagu haghweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea lasoodeang'wa bea booga gayghwahita damanda lajita sabiibu, ak gayghwahita lajita sabiibu damanda histeayda booga; ak gajayaaga hamiteang'wa ea alang'uuda, ak goopiidi jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa nea goobeaseayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' gaba ng'eanyiida hoyyoo, ak gajala, ak ea manda siida jea ghoabealeagwa; ak gaydasach diyeanga munyas aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak ea manda ng'ucheeda jea ghwahidu jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajahoana weajoodigeagwa, ak gaygoobeedeayi aba madeedeang'wa aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghahoan fih muut aba jeedeang'wa fih bughala, ak ghahoan fih bughala aba jeedeang'wa fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush; ak gaygoobeedeayi weajoodigeagwa aba madeedeang'wa aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydang'uleegwa nea ghaanung' asaang'ayiida nea ghadaardaarneegwa, ak gaydeamajeek neajeedeanyu aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajayaaga boogeaba gwalakwalooda ghayi ootiing'di, ak gajageanda geaba garayi ak geakghiisa gea eashish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydasin heeda ghaydit jea eegadoowaniisean aba jeedeang'wa, ak ea maygwajaktaneegwa gurooroodeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaneayeewa jeedeang'wa, nea ghaahuuyi ASEETEANG'WA, nea ghoahuuyi fugeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ghayi aruunaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ea moohuuwi soomjooga nyaawa; ak ea neahirjeaweadi geediga yookajeegeagwa ak gooweayi nea ghoadoabiiwji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghoorjooda aba nyoota mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama mooleeysean iit aniini, ak ea moang'waanyi diigheanyeekeasu seaniin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyeaheawi diigheanyeekeasu, nea ghwasit gurooruunatkeagwa deaweedajeegeasu, ak ea moogasi asina diigheanyeekeasu sean, ak goonyarji neajeedeanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydasineegwa ng'asheanji: gaydanung' gwashameegwa nea ghwahidu badahuukeagwa gidamuy, weasheanda ea sheagheeda ng'waan jea gagoodu gheanyanga nea ghwanung' gwarageeda eaweega. Ak gajahista boogeagwa mwadaagha, aba gideaba gayghwaak weajoodigeagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aniini bwadaw, gayghabwareagwa weajoodigeagwa; nea fugiga sideagwaan gaygoombaleegwa, ak gajamng'awa nea manda siida hoaneagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu iimooleeysean iit aniini, abeeda gaydanung' gwaheedu bileangideang'wa gicha niba ispwa aba badayda riing'eegeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydahirja ghwarjeeda uurdeang'wa, ak gaydanung' ghahang'waanyiita humng'eedeeng'wa gharinyeanda nea gawuurji ng'eanyiideang'wa lagheaneeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea uurjeengeegwa gaygaba mwadaagha, aba gideaba maygagu ng'eanyiideang'wa booga, nea geediga ng'eanyiida ea maygwaji haghweega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea agooga iyeabeadi gidamwabeadani, ak ea mooleeysean iit, gaydanung' ghwahidu gicha bayiiga suuk badahuukeagwa, niba ispwa deenyi sea riing'eegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghwahidu diyeanga jarooda jeedeang'wa, jea ghoareadeegwa diibigeagwa, nea gwaduulu dugweagwa, nea ghwanung' gang'ayiit mooneedeang'wa, ea eenung'usa heeda naweadingeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iimoogasi abiiksean aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu, ak goosinyi gidameagasiidani aniini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda eara aniini gaydasin gidamigasiidani ang'iing'i, ak abeeda aniini gaydabwareagwa niba ispwa aba badayda riing'eegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadu ng'uta badahuukeagwa, ak gaydawalda mureandooda aba gideaba noonyarji neajeeda; nea iyoabwachi geat aba jeesinga mujiinajeegeagwa gaydeadu geeyooda muy jeedeang'wa, ak gajeeyiineegwa geatinga weajoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung' ghwahidu jalooda ng'waan ak gayghoawu gadeem damanamughuush mukaate aba dahuunagi, ak gaygagooneegwa mukaateeydeang'wa gicha nea goodeen; ak ghoayaaji, ak ea majalang'uuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iing'ata ng'asheesu ak ea mooleeysean iit, ak ghoabeadi gidamwabeadani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydabeada gidamoogasiidani nea ghaanyareaschi, ak gwaheedu bileangideang'wa niba ispwa aba badayda riing'eegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajayaaga banyeega orjoogeagwa, nea ghoayaaji banyeega haweegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanyarjeaweada ghoorajeegeagwa oobateewean mida heetiyeada, ak gaydabwaay heedeang'wa bea wagiida abiita geediga ng'andidi, ak geahisi muscheekeagwa badahuuka muscheeka haleanjeedeang'wa mawoosa aseecheeka; ak gayghwasteagwa gurooroodeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanyarjeaweada mujiinajeegeagwa, nea ghoorajeegeagwa bea ghadooweeda gaydanung' ea manda sih, ak ea maydagasa shearooda eaghadoawandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanyarja ng'eanyiideang'wa, ea ghahamng'eanyi weajoodigeagwa mida jeeda ng'eanyiida iidaah nyariida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' adarsiina bugusta eemoojiga, ak gaydayiin geeshteang'wa ng'uta; nea ng'eanyiideang'wa ea maygwanda sih, ak gaydanyarjeaweada mujiinajeegeagwa ea ghoah raghoonyeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda gaygahoosassa ng'eanyiida sabaatohajeagaaschi earapeadi niiw raghoonyaan, nea goondi jeeda ng'eanyiida weajoodigeagwa; ak abeeda gaygafuuf ng'eanyiida, ak gahoosasa sabaatohajeagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi niiw raghoonyeandean gayghwanyas fuufta, was fuufta ghayi mandana aba sabaatohajeegeagwa damanda oopideewi ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba fugiga ikeagwa siipuudiin, gaydayiin muuwda jeesinga gurooruunatka nyaawa aba jeeda darooraka weajoodiga nyaawa; ak gaygoomng'eaw nyeashta seendooda ghuut jeameeda, ak gaygamng'awda siida mang'awa madeeda ng'uta, ak gaygoobeedeayi nea manda siida hean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobeedeayiisa geat, nea gawuurji gil mang'awa ng'uta, nea manda siida hean; ak ea majandeawana uurda jea amiinaadawana aba madeeda weajoodigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajooshealsiina bugusta eemoojiga, ak gajeebung'seegwa ng'eanyiida weajoodigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea boosteangeagwa gaygwarageada aba jeeda ng'eanyiida weajoodigeagwa aba munyasnacheeka nyaawa; nea aba badayda munyasnacheeka ghweaniga nyaawa gaygwarageadayda saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iiduukuuna munyasnacheeka nyaawa ea munyasnacheeka ghweaniga nyaawa aba jeeda ng'asheega munyas simanean, nea ghabeada gidameagasiidani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwasunu eara aniini ghaabeadi gidamwabeada saawa ak geayeadu ea ghwahidu ng'eanyiida weajoodiga nyaawa; abeeda gurooruunatka nyaawa meayaada ghasmeahooda iiyaat geat ng'eanyi ak ghamwas lasooda aba riing'eega nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydaapkaat neajeedeanyu sea Yakobo, ak gaydaapkaat neajeedeanyu sea Isaka nea neajeedeanyu sea Abrahamu, ak gaydaapkaat ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ng'eanyiida gaygwanung'usa buuneeda heeda, ak gahoosasa sabaatohajeega nyaawa earapeadi niiw raghoonyeanda iimanda buuneeda; ak gayghamwas lasita aba badayda riing'eega nyaawa, aba gideaba gafool diigheanyeekeasu, nea ghwasit gurooruunatka nyaawa diigheanyeekeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba ng'asheesu seaniin, aba damanda mideewa ng'eanyiida weajoodiga nyaawa, aniini maydahista saawa, ghana dasit saawa nea geagasayi dalas uhuuda ak geanyarji neajeedeanyu sea saawa; aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu aba badahuuka nyaawa gaydaapkaat neajeeda sea gheamba ghweaniga nyaawa, ghayi earuuni jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri aba madeeda gheanyanga eemoojiga, ak abeeda ghaahuuyi ASEETA nyaawa: aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
